{'symbol': 'ZION', 'date': '2021-10-22 13:24:00', 'title': "ZIONS BANCORPORATION'S BOARD APPROVES $325 MILLION SHARE REPURCHASE AND DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK", 'text': "SALT LAKE CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ZIONS BANCORPORATION, N.A. (NASDAQ: ZION) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (“BOARD”) AUTHORIZED A SHARE REPURCHASE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021 OF UP TO $325 MILLION, EQUALING 3.2% OF THE MARKET VALUE OF THE COMPANY. THE BOARD DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.38 PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE NOVEMBER 18, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 10, 2021. ADDITIONALLY, THE BOARD DECLARED REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON THE COMPANY'S VARI"}